OL,3,AOpportunity Party emerges as kingmaker
OL,4,Ain New Zealand election with Labour and
OL,5,ANational neck-and-neck
OL,6,
OL,7,FVotes are being counted in New Zealand
OL,8,Fwhere early election results show a
OL,9,Ftight race between the National and
OL,10,FLabour parties
OL,12,FPM Christopher Luxon and his
OL,13,FNational-led coalition are seeking a
OL,14,Fsecond term. His main challenger is
OL,15,FChris Hipkins, leader of the
OL,16,Fcentre-left Labour Party
OL,18,FThe latest electoral commission data
OL,19,Fsuggests National is slightly ahead
OL,20,Fwith 29.45% of the vote compared to
OL,21,FNational's 29.25% - where things stand
OL,22,Fnow
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
