OL,3,AOpportunity Party emerges as kingmaker
OL,4,Ain New Zealand election with Labour and
OL,5,ANational neck-and-neck
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the centrist Opportunity
OL,8,FParty crosses the 5% threshold to enter
OL,9,Fparliament for the first time - leader
OL,10,FQiulae Wong says she's open to working
OL,11,Fwith either of the main parties
OL,13,FNew Zealand's voting system - mixed
OL,14,Fmember proportional - means most
OL,15,Fgovernments are coalitions. The
OL,16,Fcountry's also on course to see its
OL,17,Fbiggest parliament ever after this
OL,18,Felection
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
