OL,3,AOpportunity Party emerges as kingmaker
OL,4,Ain New Zealand election with Labour and
OL,5,ANational neck-and-neck
OL,6,
OL,7,FSymone, 28, says most of her friends
OL,8,Fhave left New Zealand or are
OL,9,Fconsidering leaving. She tells our
OL,10,Freporter in Wellington: "I think we're
OL,11,Fall tired... that's one of the reasons
OL,12,FI want change"
